+/// F7 regression (multi-FN spine-brick): an FN in GOING_ONLINE at boot тАФ a
+/// NORMAL state for an FN that was mid return-online-drain when the process
+/// last restarted тАФ must NOT fail the whole reconcile and deny the runtime to
